Subject: Adapt Jonx PAL to Rust 1.100 and gate native sockets

What: update allocator/error/fs internal interfaces for the shared compiler.
Why: preserve the existing ARM implementation and its aligned-realloc fix;
     prevent native socket handles escaping their SocketBase owner task.
Scope: AArch64 PAL imported from jonx/rust-aros 2e2845efb6aaa111b5a26c9685e96d08fad340f4.
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0, matching the original Jonx/Rust source files.
Upstream status: local integration patch; no submission authorized.

